<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">chrysalis-aid</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Chrysalis Aid</ansi> spell channels stabilizing Chrysalis energy into a
fallen ally, pulling them back from the threshold of death. It is
applied through the <ansi fg="command">aid</ansi> skill rather than cast directly in combat.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">aid [target]</ansi>     Automatically applies when you aid a fallen ally.

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> N/A (triggered by aid skill)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 0

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - This spell is not cast manually — it fires when using the aid skill.
  - Requires the aid skill to be trained before it functions.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help aid</ansi>
